cff-version: 1.2.0
title: CoBreeder
abstract: >-
  Constraint optimisation for designing group-living captive breeding programmes.
  Allocates individuals to breeding groups using CP-SAT, subject to group size,
  sex-composition and relatedness constraints, under a choice of objective functions.
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the conference paper in preferred-citation
  below.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/MattForshaw/AAAI25-CaptiveBreeding
# Author list and affiliations taken from the published paper. Note the supplied BibTeX
# abbreviated this as "and others" after Jensen, which omitted vonHoldt and reordered
# the middle of the list; the paper's order is authoritative and is used here.
